# The public site is web/ and the packages it builds from. Everything else in
# this monorepo — 2.8 GB of font sources, 3D mascot work, the apps' native
# projects — stays off a site upload. The two workspace manifests stay, because
# `npm install` reads every workspace the root package.json names.
/font-library
/output
/docs
/scripts
/supabase
/user/*
!/user/package.json
/admin/*
!/admin/package.json
/web/.next
/web/.vercel
/web/tests
/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
